First ascension after only three months involves playing nethack every
day, reading about nethack everyday, and thinking about nethack
everyday. This was my first run to the quest ever so I was breathing
very hard towards the end. I was very lucky early but it was mostly
obsolete by the castle.

So I started and quickly went down to the mines. On the first level I
found a +5 elven mithril coat, which did help a lot until the castle.
Then in mine town, I found a bones file- a barbarian that never made
it. He had a bag of holding and 6 candles. The lighting shop was empty
so he must have bought all six that were there. He had a lamp so maybe
it was magic. Altar was co-aligned so I made so holy water and blessed
the lamp. Rubbed for a wish- +2 speed boots. Since Orb of Fate is a
luckstone I did not go to mine's end. Ok, down to Oracle. Another
bones file- Magicbane and cloak-so this must be MR. Neither were
cursed. Soko had BoH( 9th straight time...).

Kept going down, found a maple wand. (E)ngrave-- For what do you wish?
2 blessed scrolls of charging. ID the wand--now (0:2). +2 SDSM, +2
Helm of Telepathy, 2 blessed scrolls of genocide,Blessed magic marker.
Saved the rest for later. Geno L and h.

Ok get to Medusa, eel electric attack fries my WoW. Well, shucks.
First big mistake of game.

Get to castle. =oL to the back and the WoW. (0:1) Still had ?oC so I
had 5 wishes. Blessed fixed greased cloak of MR so I do not lose AC
with fire traps. 3 magic markers. Write ?oGeno, Goodbye ;.

Time for the quest, very easy (is it the easiest?) Orb of Fate--Best
combat wombat artifact in the game. Very heavy though, hard to manage
items even with blessed BoH.

Went up to co-aligned altar on d lvl 20. Dropped unided rings, both
blessed- SD and conflict.

Spent 30000 turns altar camping got Mjollnir and 9 points of
protection.. Wrest WoW for Gauntlets of power.

Second big mistake of game-- sacrificing wererat. Three dragons later
I was back to normal but I lost all my protection.

Ok I map Gehennom but it takes four hours to find Vlad and another two
to find the VS. Orcus gives me my one wand of death. Time to prepare
for final run.

I read a unided scroll thinking I had IDed all the dangerous ones. Who
was that Maud person anyway? This was my last big mistake.Wrotes some
scrolls of ID to help me and it was not that bad. Remap Gehennom. I
have one wand of death so it had better last me. Zap Rodney, get book,
go to sanctum. Easy, Rodney was in the sanctum with Moloch's priest
