the same level 7 times.
Ran into Rodney a lot. Charged Wand of Death. Used it two more times.
(1:4)

Got to dlvl1. Wrote four scrolls of gold detection.

Plane of earth. Took three charges to kill Rodney. Only one left and I
do not have charging scrolls or empty scrolls.

Plane of air. I was really worried about this one since I had AC-24
and only 270 HP. But, wow, I was amazed by the power of Conflict. Only
got engulfed once for about 30 damage.

Plane of Fire. Portal was extremely close, took 20 seconds.

Plane of Water. Without ; ,this was easy.

Astral Plane. At this point I was trembling with excitement. Ok take
stock. Wand of death with one charge, blessed magic lamp from
somewhere (I forget), +7 Excaliber,+6 silver saber, +0 magicbane,+0
mjollnir, 2 holy waters, no healing items, blindfold/telepathy, AC
-24, 270 HP, conflict.

 Take out the one hostile angel. Hmm, it seems Famine is guarding the
